[{"client_msg_id":"f33f00d4-8fa4-49ca-9b71-f17a4ebddf8d","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"↓みたいにしておいて、\n```REPO=$(gh repo list $1 ${FUZZYCLONE_OPTS} --json nameWithOwner -q '.[].nameWithOwner' | fzf)```\n一時的な変数を使ってオプションを与えられるようにするっていうのも手なのかもと思いました。\n```FUZZYCLONE_OPTS=\"--limit 5 --public\" gh fuzzyclone```\n","ts":"1630583605.055100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4SoB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ae71627-5644-42ab-95e4-103ef6db48e7","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"なんかのオプションがSearchにしかなくて、そんな変則的な感じに","ts":"1630582579.053100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xNSui"}]},{"client_msg_id":"356b14c7-bbe3-4944-9ef4-8a2ec740e9cd","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"GitHub CLIのリポジトリ一覧は、確か呼び方によってv3 APIのSearchを呼ぶ場合と、v4 APIのRepositoriesを呼ぶ場合があった気がする","ts":"1630582560.052700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MT/8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11afbe3e-e965-4370-aaa8-0ac3c55e5f5b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"実際の所100あれば足りる人がほとんどだと思う","ts":"1630581542.050900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cCE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5427c3d-51bd-40da-ad7e-02f9e5f43e59","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"~世の中には1.5kもリポジトリを持っている人だっているんですよ~","ts":"1630581521.050100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"mattn_yoshi","count":5,"users":["U78A6ESHM","U81LLJ340","U06ECBRTJ","UDPT2BZ6E","U7JL1UKKL"]},{"name":"doushite-mattn","count":2,"users":["U0238G3KV8D","U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h/TVJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76d9c606-d38b-47e1-8890-08d0f049b2f8","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"直近の利用順ならとりあえず100あれば十分そうな気はしますね。","ts":"1630581482.049400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3uKl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e7218408-0c3e-4b47-980f-787157162cde","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"APIリファレンス見ると、 `gh api`の場合は sort にオプションありますね\n\u0026gt; Can be one of `created`, `updated`, `pushed`, `full_name`.\n\u0026gt; Default: `create`","ts":"1630580826.048900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01B7FN0XBK"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ebe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ffaa75d-85da-436f-8633-cadd6f104ca0","type":"message","user":"U01B7FN0XBK","text":"おお、すいませんわたし gh api のほうを見てた。たしかに gh repo list だと更新順でした。","ts":"1630580704.048100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D80"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2fe7a7c2-fba5-490b-891f-4f87fb6c8d45","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"あ、でも全部リストアップするなら、予め除外できるもの除外するのはありですね","ts":"1630580633.047400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a8wDU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a1966c9-87a2-45c6-b537-f9f4b1e6ab9a","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"最近pushしたレポジトリが先頭に来てます","ts":"1630580605.046600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"thA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d896f1f-8f47-4305-8559-ee46c549f9fd","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"私が使ってる感じ、`gh list`は直近の利用順なので、 `--no-archived`はいらないかなと","ts":"1630580578.046300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L8XyZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3622d325-6184-4523-81e8-fbb2de5ec18d","type":"message","user":"U01B7FN0XBK","text":"リポジトリの作成順だ！","ts":"1630580567.046000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SdGN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91a3a396-44f7-4776-a0b8-6227817bddef","type":"message","user":"U01B7FN0XBK","text":"これ、取得したリポジトリの順番がよくわからない感じなんですよね。更新順でも名前順でもなさそうで。アーカイブしてるやつもあるし。なので、途中で切られると件数が多い場合は不便かもしれない。いまみてたら `--no-archived` っていうオプションあるんですね。これよさそう。","ts":"1630580525.045000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qIi7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8cb849d-47b8-43ce-b9fa-8e7faf68ffc4","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"APIドキュメント読むとlimitは100が最大値で、以降はペジネート必須ですね。APIで取得数が100切るまでループかければ全部取得できますけど、時間もかかるでしょうし、あんまり現実的な感じがしないですね……。\n\u003chttps://docs.github.com/ja/rest/reference/repos\u003e","ts":"1630580285.042700","edited":{"user":"U022XK5866Q","ts":"1630580789.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u/6=U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a0e483f-de5a-46d9-a4a3-cfed7465bc4f","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"こんな感じでデフォルトオプション指定しておいて、ユーザーにリミットを環境変数で委ねるのが簡便\n```--limit ${_GH_FUZZYCLONE_LIMIT:-30}```","ts":"1630579090.040500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ultrafastparrot","count":1,"users":["U06ECBRTJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y=X2S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d16da05-d739-4638-8eaf-67a1776e864e","type":"message","user":"U01B7FN0XBK","text":"-F オプションなんてのがあったのか","ts":"1630576880.039200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tc5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"089599b5-b12f-48ae-8910-8bb127d22ded","type":"message","user":"U01B7FN0XBK","text":"あ、ちょうど gh でリポジトリ一覧取った時に30件で止まってたんですけど `gh api orgs/XX/repos\\?per_page=100` として限界突破した。個人的な環境ではこれで大丈夫でした。","ts":"1630576825.039000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"benri","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qBl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a647a65c-7d96-42c1-aa0f-2657902f1517","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Perl全く書けない","ts":"1630574382.037000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dUI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4acfd72c-4006-47f9-bbee-155ba44760af","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"~ここはgitに倣ってperlで…~","ts":"1630574374.036700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5avB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"deb627a5-8dfe-4036-b4b9-3a46bed74871","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"```var repos []*github.Repository\nrepoOption := \u0026amp;github.RepositoryListOptions{\n  ListOptions: github.ListOptions{\n    Page:    1,\n    PerPage: 100,\n  },\n}\nfor {\n  repo, resp, err := client.Repositories.List(ctx, \"\", repoOption)\n  if err != nil {\n    //log.Errorf(ctx, \"%+v\", err)\n    log.Fatal(err)\n  }\n  repos = append(repos, repo...)\n  if resp.NextPage == 0 {\n    break\n  }\n  repoOption.ListOptions.Page++\n}```\ngo で全件取ったときのコード置いておきます","ts":"1630574344.036000","edited":{"user":"U06ECBRTJ","ts":"1630574371.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sA1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"602e515c-8c4a-4f17-9fc6-826d3d465e67","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"シェルスクリプトでやるの面倒そう…","ts":"1630574264.035500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L559K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f3f6822d-f86f-44f0-bb07-6ac8f64c4c61","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"(ちょうど github actions のリポジトリ横断結果取得アプリで似たようなことやってたので…","ts":"1630573979.034800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DXB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36d2d2a8-db0b-421f-9331-1e885591d460","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"お、見みてみます","ts":"1630573971.034600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=jV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ca2d5b7-4349-4ae1-8ef3-7adaf90617d1","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://cli.github.com/manual/gh_api\u003e\n全件取りたいならこっちかな","ts":"1630573948.034000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/Ur3k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"628575fb-077b-4063-a29c-915b842516c4","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"limitを適切に指定すれば行けそうだけど、ユーザーに指定させる形になるのは如何なものか…","ts":"1630573946.033900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0HVy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5930db29-8f72-43a0-8811-4603620c3c11","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あ、そうなのか","ts":"1630573878.032800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b3H6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8796d21d-4759-4528-aa7f-668d336d46a7","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://cli.github.com/manual/gh_repo_list\u003e\ndefault 30 ですね","ts":"1630573870.032600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uswi5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dba2cb2f-ada2-465e-9080-9e70ac7ed92f","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ぽいですね。fzfでページネーションする感じかな","ts":"1630573802.032100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5Qn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b1e58d9-346e-49af-ac61-5497cc44f9c7","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"ページネーションしないと駄目っぽいですけどね","ts":"1630573779.031700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GAX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a53f15ca-ccf2-4459-afd4-2003bef2ce91","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"だれか、リポジトリが30以上あるorganizationに所属している方に手伝って頂きたい","ts":"1630573729.031200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vim7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42cfb87b-c427-4423-9b3a-53a94552638f","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ただ、これ再現できないんだよなぁ","ts":"1630573678.030400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nLtf/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4f84974-b0b2-4d85-b8cd-d7baf293f114","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"organizationを指定すると30までしかリポジトリが表示されないというissueが来た\n\u003chttps://github.com/hashue/gh-fuzzyclone/issues/7\u003e","ts":"1630573653.029800","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/hashue/gh-fuzzyclone/issues/7|#7 30 Repos Max\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/hashue/gh-fuzzyclone/issues/7|#7 30 Repos Max\u003e","text":"If you have more than 30 repos in an org account. Running\n\ngh fuzzyclone *orgname*\n\nwill only return the first 30.","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/hashue/gh-fuzzyclone|hashue/gh-fuzzyclone\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1630550105}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NRk"}]}]
